---
---

<section id="engineering" class="py-20 px-8 bg-[#050810] border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="text-xs tracking-[0.3em] text-green-500 mb-12 border-b border-white/5 pb-2 uppercase font-mono">
      // Principios de Ingeniería
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12">
      {/* 01 | OFFLINE-FIRST ARCHITECTURE */}
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 group">
        <div class="md:w-24">
          <span class="text-4xl font-mono font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-green-500 transition-colors duration-300">01</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 pl-6 border-l border-slate-800 group-hover:border-green-600 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-2">
             <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-200 uppercase tracking-wide">OFFLINE-FIRST ARCHITECTURE</h3>
             <span class="bg-green-900/10 text-green-500 text-[9px] border border-green-900/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">PROVEN</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-3 max-w-2xl">
            "Sistemas operativos ante fallos de red. WASM para ejecución de lógica crítica localmente."
          </p>
          <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-green-400/80 bg-green-900/5 p-2 rounded border border-green-900/10 inline-block">
            > Validador v5.0: 99%+ precisión operativa sin dependencia de conectividad.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 02 | PERFORMANCE-DRIVEN DESIGN */}
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 group">
        <div class="md:w-24">
          <span class="text-4xl font-mono font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-green-500 transition-colors duration-300">02</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 pl-6 border-l border-slate-800 group-hover:border-green-600 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-2">
             <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-200 uppercase tracking-wide">PERFORMANCE-DRIVEN DESIGN</h3>
             <span class="bg-green-900/10 text-green-500 text-[9px] border border-green-900/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">PROVEN</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-3 max-w-2xl">
            "Rust para lo crítico, SQL optimizado y arquitecturas lean sin bloat."
          </p>
          <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-green-400/80 bg-green-900/5 p-2 rounded border border-green-900/10 inline-block">
            > 24% mejora en queries DB2. 85-90% reducción de tiempo operativo en SAC.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 03 | PROACTIVE SECURITY & VALIDATION */}
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 group">
        <div class="md:w-24">
          <span class="text-4xl font-mono font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-green-500 transition-colors duration-300">03</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 pl-6 border-l border-slate-800 group-hover:border-green-600 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-2">
             <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-200 uppercase tracking-wide">PROACTIVE SECURITY & VALIDATION</h3>
             <span class="bg-green-900/10 text-green-500 text-[9px] border border-green-900/30 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">PROVEN</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-3 max-w-2xl">
            "Validación preventiva desde el diseño y cumplimiento de estándares OWASP."
          </p>
          <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-green-400/80 bg-green-900/5 p-2 rounded border border-green-900/10 inline-block">
            > Detección de problemas 5 días antes del recibo físico. 0 incidentes de seguridad.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
